# character enters
join weird_cat leftmost

# greeting lines
weird_cat: Yo! Welcome to your new house. It's a bit bare, but I'm sure you'll cozy it up in no time.
weird_cat: Make sure you’ve got enough for rent, utilities, food, phone, etc.

# a choice
weird_cat: So… what do you want to do first?
- Unpack your stuff
	weird_cat: Nice! Let's make the place feel like home.
- Take a nap
	weird_cat: Already tired? Fair enough, moving is exhausting.
- Go outside
	weird_cat: Fresh air is always a good idea!

# text input
[text_input text="What’s your secret password?" var="secret_code" default="1234"]

if {secret_code} != "3.14159":
	weird_cat: Hmm… that’s not the magic number I was expecting.
	[signal arg="wrong_password"]
else:
	weird_cat: Whoa! You cracked the code! 🐱

# timeline ends
[end_timeline]
